{% if has('search_collections') %}
The complete search arguments are collection, queries, query, sort, date_after, date_before,
date_unknown_only, mentioned_date_after, mentioned_date_before, size_min, size_max,
folder_term_id, filename_only and facet_filters.
collection accepts a name or list. Omission or [] searches every permitted collection.
query defaults to empty text. queries optionally adds up to 12 forms. Duplicate forms run once.
An empty query browses all filter matches. Search forms merge matching document identities.
sort contains field and direction. field is relevance, date, file_size or name. direction is asc or desc.
Omission uses the default relevance order.
date_after and date_before use inclusive UTC epoch seconds for the document date.
mentioned_date_after and mentioned_date_before use inclusive UTC epoch seconds for dates extracted from text.
date_unknown_only=true selects documents with no known document date. Do not combine it with a known-date range.
size_min and size_max are inclusive byte limits. folder_term_id selects a returned folder term.
filename_only=true restricts the query to names and paths. False uses document contents.
facet_filters maps valid facet names to lists of returned value text. Omission applies no facet filter.
Values within one facet are alternatives. Different facet filters must all match.

Each result includes collection, file_hash, path, snippet and available type, date and size.
q lists the zero-based forms that found the row. query_forms reports each form's count.
word_counts verifies indexed words. suggestions lists nearby indexed spellings with counts.
Read query_notes for repaired syntax, unknown filters, partial results and failures.
more continues the result. Copy it into read_more. An empty first page needs no repeated identical call.

This minimal call searches all permitted collections.
```json
{"query":"\"Joe Wilkinson\""}
```
This advanced call combines query forms, collection scope, sort, dates, size and facet filters.
```json
{"collection":["alpha","beta"],"queries":["JoeBWilkinson@cs.com","\"Joe Wilkinson\""],"query":"Wilkinson","sort":{"field":"date","direction":"asc"},"date_after":1577836800,"date_before":1609459199,"mentioned_date_after":1577836800,"mentioned_date_before":1609459199,"size_min":100,"size_max":1000000,"folder_term_id":42,"filename_only":false,"facet_filters":{"file_types":["email"],"email_to":["JoeBWilkinson@cs.com"]}}
```
This separate call finds files without a known document date.
```json
{"query":"report","filename_only":true,"date_unknown_only":true}
```
Replace collection, folder and facet values with values returned for the current chat.
